        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Cal-Royal ESC45-05 Storeroom Function Lever for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis Narrow Escutcheon Plate Storeroom Function Lever (Entrance by lever\r\nwhen unlocked by key. Key removable only when locked.) is suitable for all Narrow or Wide Stile Doors \r\n(aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/crossbar-narrow-stile-surface-vertical-rod-exit-device-cal-royal-45-svr-1277763\"><b>Crossbar Narrow Stile Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>.  Heavy duty surface vertical rod panic device for narrow stiles.  </p><p>Packaged with mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/narrow-escutcheon-plate-entry-lever-for-panic-device-cal-esc45-00-1278517\"><b>Entry Lever</b></a>, <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/narrow-escutcheon-plate-passage-lever-for-panic-device-cal-esc45-30-1278526\"><b>Passage Lever</b></a>, and <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/narrow-escutcheon-plate-dummy-lever-for-panic-device-cal-esc45-40-1278619\"><b>Dummy Trim</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for CAL-ESC45-05 Keyed Storeroom Function Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li> Storeroom Function (ANSI F09) - Entrance by lever\r\nwhen unlocked by key. Key removable only when locked.</li>\r\n<li>Base Material: Steel with Aluminum Alloy Escutcheon Trim</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Width: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Height: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Standard 6 Pin Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Rigid, Non clutch mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Grade 1</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAL-ESC45-Installation.pdf?v=1774586117\" target=\"new\"><b>Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
