                "description": "CAL-ESC45-05 This is a narrow Escutcheon Plate Storeroom Function Lever (Entrance by lever\r\nwhen unlocked by key. Key removable only when locked.)  is suitable for wide or narrow Stile Doors \r\n(aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  Heavy duty commercial set will not cover standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door prep.",
